class Solution {
    public long maxTotalValue(int[] nums, int k) {
        // Step 1: Initialize variables for global max and min
        int maxval = Integer.MIN_VALUE;
        int minval = Integer.MAX_VALUE;

        // Step 2: Find global max and min in one pass
        for(int num:nums){
            maxval = Math.max(maxval, num);
            minval = Math.min(minval, num);
        }

        // Step 3: Compute result as k * (max - min)
        return 1L * k * (maxval - minval); //1L forces the multiplication to happen in long instead of int, preventing overflow.
    }
}


Time Complexity: O(n) (single pass to find max and min).
Space Complexity: O(1) (constant extra space).
